Package: ninjutso-battery-tray
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Ninjutso Battery Tray contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/DrStopor/ninjutso-battery-tray
Depends: @DEPENDS@, libvulkan1
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers, xwayland
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Ninjutso Ten battery status in the system tray
 Read battery level, charging state, connection, configured polling rate and DPI
 without changing mouse settings. GPUI card with five languages and four themes.
 Uses X11/XWayland and StatusNotifierItem/DBusMenu. Native Wayland is not supported.
 License: MIT; see /usr/share/doc/ninjutso-battery-tray/LICENSE.
 Bundled Source Sans 3 and Noto fonts retain SIL OFL 1.1; see licenses/fonts in that directory.
